 147:Drivers/STM32G0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g0xx_hal_i2c.c ****                             Then usage of this option I2C_OTHER_AND_LAST_FRAME at the last frame to
 148:Drivers/STM32G0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g0xx_hal_i2c.c ****                             generation of STOP condition.
